pi.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"25047f280afad29e5b119e68d62085c6f7ca541a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/25047f280afad29e5b119e68d62085c6f7ca541a","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/25047f280afad29e5b119e68d62085c6f7ca541a"}]},{"sha":"dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","node_id":"C_kwDOS9rTN9oAKGRiZTBjZDkyMGMwYTRkMmY1ZjYxZmNlMjEyNjhlZTMwY2QzMmFlOGQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Derek","email":"derekgranito@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-17T21:57:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-17T21:57:41Z"},"message":"docs(skill): rewrite test-expert for the single-node fork (it was a verbatim operator copy) (#31)\n\nnode-template's test-expert was a near-verbatim copy of the operator monorepo's:\n'in this monorepo', nodes/<node>/app paths, pnpm -F <node>, multi-node stack/\nisolation, the cogni-operator-test app, DoltHub test orgs, the env-e2e node-\nformation lane, poly/resy examples — almost none of which exist in a flat single-\nnode fork. It described a dozen commands the fork doesn't have (test:meta,\ntest:contract, test:arch, test:stack, check:fast, arch:check, check:docs). A node\nauthor following it was actively misled.\n\nRewritten against this node's REAL surface (verified, not assumed):\n- CI = exactly static / unit / component; stack/external/money are local-only.\n- Real scripts only: pnpm test, test:component, test:external, test:external:money,\n  check, db:check, typecheck. No invented commands.\n- Flat app/ paths; pnpm --filter @cogni/node-template-app, not -F <node>.\n- Drops operator-only scaffolding: env-e2e/node-formation, multi-node, cogni-\n  operator-test, DoltHub orgs, poly/resy, coverage-dial, tests/lint, e2e/Playwright.\n- Keeps the universal value: layer-picking, never-mock-the-DB, the dotenv-CWD trap,\n  skip-gate ordering, component-as-RLS-gate (links schema-update).\n\nThis is the source fix; it propagates to forks via the same path as the other\nskills (manual until the fork-sync webhook lands, bug.5036). Closes the last\nknown toothless skill in the node-template audit.","tree":{"sha":"f90eb888a32b02989f5164440f13f97da0170478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/f90eb888a32b02989f5164440f13f97da0170478"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMxhVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAokoQAIdwKSgnT8PEknvJ2DRrS/i1\nltt/1MDTYnCOineKWOtbCEykgiZsOeXbnPmfDQPqL79F6Mjz7Rc3BXQBRjysr564\nSrDzEwqJIcZ4WEL3Ti8Y6+/ke/oOP5xlLbCiyxkYKNXwb+bJGcbEGcXn2siQQg+J\nbjru1bWVKDbBaMw/vchhBvnc+/3zuoYcYh/4OVQvXnQs78so2JwFEomjSjYGkddQ\ns1JvaRPbpgv8d5thXKRR82Cv14/Nmc0oGn/JAQEbHOLSqihquqiPKJIXTR9V4qd3\n1hHkYF9v+5LSv71wRFrLI8ETE50Cv/F0pW/ca0mhvtuKM0pIDbRl5bWoQhOSa/Tj\nOE31dEH1Xnv2BF9Dw42bO1dq/k9WQzzxUPPk4dqU8R1/KkUkYlu5LFPC9iAb2XZY\nG4N4LbWzfYzV0WfbqVTAMFXmPJe/pfummIxZeB9fZbyDa9mG/QH5hUMxcLGlS7Xu\nm30tUPWeQT32Ffw/DAKUe17OnX8JqrgcTvJNSu/Zb7aFfrLXWj5OWyiAcm1t4ecb\n/UK9MMapQGkwmaFuS06H8XpTtmc3y0yeZCcd1SSWoaRPOeMs0RvR+xmWAJuxUKu4\n/8I0MZK3HLl+qrILhddQyCSzSBbgw2CqV1KYke1CGYLSATXIZtCZX/PROKv2s1BX\nlDI9j7VNBoKcePFshHg8\n=LeFC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f90eb888a32b02989f5164440f13f97da0170478\nparent 55b0c712097ac201b1530f72c2e1090f1bc8bf0c\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781733461 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781733461 -0400\n\ndocs(skill): rewrite test-expert for the single-node fork (it was a verbatim operator copy) (#31)\n\nnode-template's test-expert was a near-verbatim copy of the operator monorepo's:\n'in this monorepo', nodes/<node>/app paths, pnpm -F <node>, multi-node stack/\nisolation, the cogni-operator-test app, DoltHub test orgs, the env-e2e node-\nformation lane, poly/resy examples — almost none of which exist in a flat single-\nnode fork. It described a dozen commands the fork doesn't have (test:meta,\ntest:contract, test:arch, test:stack, check:fast, arch:check, check:docs). A node\nauthor following it was actively misled.\n\nRewritten against this node's REAL surface (verified, not assumed):\n- CI = exactly static / unit / component; stack/external/money are local-only.\n- Real scripts only: pnpm test, test:component, test:external, test:external:money,\n  check, db:check, typecheck. No invented commands.\n- Flat app/ paths; pnpm --filter @cogni/node-template-app, not -F <node>.\n- Drops operator-only scaffolding: env-e2e/node-formation, multi-node, cogni-\n  operator-test, DoltHub orgs, poly/resy, coverage-dial, tests/lint, e2e/Playwright.\n- Keeps the universal value: layer-picking, never-mock-the-DB, the dotenv-CWD trap,\n  skip-gate ordering, component-as-RLS-gate (links schema-update).\n\nThis is the source fix; it propagates to forks via the same path as the other\nskills (manual until the fork-sync webhook lands, bug.5036). Closes the last\nknown toothless skill in the node-template audit.","verified_at":"2026-06-17T21:57:41Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d/comments","author":{"login":"derekg1729","id":58641509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjQxNTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58641509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729","html_url":"https://github.com/derekg1729","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/gis