,"date":"2026-06-17T23:21:56Z"},"message":"feat(knowledge): adopt DELETE_IS_CLEAN — delete op, not soft-deprecate (#38)\n\nPort of Cogni-DAO/cogni#1730. Replaces the contribution `deprecate` op (which\nset status='deprecated' — write-only cruft nothing reads) with a `delete` op:\nDAG-safe (409 if still cited; cascades own outbound edges), hard-deletes the row.\nDolt history preserves content + commits + attribution. Keeps node-template in\nlockstep with the operator standard (no node should set the 'deprecated' standard).","tree":{"sha":"b11176857d51fdbe5a72a1bfe4a4db501128350a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/b11176857d51fdbe5a72a1bfe4a4db501128350a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMywUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnBkQAFwUAXkiiXAFtAHGCHooYcKq\nuIl2XxDZFcl5xuG/E9vjSH6oTLJgiQfC0Cc5T/FuYpQ4TIZXh9wH1WLlbhlcp1Pw\nACbgIV5FXrv3cG2tAmLhdPMmapyRHzB8XWyc39uHvEBmAu4lRhqHvRfuURRzb62k\nWefGhuVdPy9I2H3k8whkMFNTf6e0Wah9xLXfUiDWMhOpgbbH1EPlb3f6zxOkSNY5\nMgxg4Ot9OknqnsIXQsYKb7d52QwvZ6OhUaIj3JDG9AcxmqEWbmi0DUnQKRf9jafR\nk1tVzB+JajTuVEb7uk9AJJ36yn3NadQQbyk7zpqR8U6NlsaeEb1IBcCV3IG5UKKL\nylFsh1M2rLuNu0nNZJJeqfs4Q5MEtRnapUA4SsLg6QMWfE6u/v6KXyEIXJZ4w9s6\nreFnm7/OIu1xKgWXcEKwA55wTUkuKgZBhdr7uCyMDn6c2A2ctTJzvEoXo3XvcG0G\nAjr1rU7ykOHBxk+pKfhOnM4fTMJkTZwCq0NTQ9E9aC1qyjxeCpkYio0+xwGzEDt0\not+umNrxPO/V4OJMjjed9Qnct+FslvutJ8upbreimIzdh8CqDyOmgDfOGZrTdaIv\nD3+jh3dCuep7W+oiUTsITTO5fVQHqspa9aV7+kIiky/FX7FweCtb+6veb7ehKwu4\ncc41tfbNbmrwdsDKpz9H\n=I0L3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b11176857d51fdbe5a72a1bfe4a4db501128350a\nparent dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781738516 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781738516 -0400\n\nfeat(knowledge): adopt DELETE_IS_CLEAN — delete op, not soft-deprecate (#38)\n\nPort of Cogni-DAO/cogni#1730. Replaces the contribution `deprecate` op (which\nset status='deprecated' — write-only cruft nothing reads) with a `delete` op:\nDAG-safe (409 if still cited; cascades own outbound edges), hard-deletes the row.\nDolt history preserves content + commits + attribution. Keeps node-template in\nlockstep with the operator standard (no node should set the 'deprecated' standard).","verified_at":"2026-06-17T23:21:57Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6/comments","author":{"login":"derekg1729","id":58641509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjQxNTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58641509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729","html_url":"https://github.com/derekg1729","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/dbe0cd920c0a4d2f5f61fce21268ee30cd32ae8d"}]},{"sha":"4d838666cb8e7baf9c5beb46b195b7ec727fa986","node_id":"C_kwDOS9rTN9oAKDRkODM4NjY2Y2I4ZTdiYWY5YzViZWI0NmIxOTViN2VjNzI3ZmE5ODY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Derek","email":"derekgranito@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-18T05:48:43Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-18T05:48:43Z"},"message":"fix(conductor): derive auth root from git, not a personal cogni-template path (#40)\n\nAUTH_ROOT hardcoded $HOME/dev/cogni-template as its final fallback, so on any\nnode other than the operator apex the setup script symlinked the wrong checkout's\n.env.cogni (wrong creds + var names) over the node's own and aborted with\n'exists and is not a symlink'.\n\nDerive the canonical (main) workspace from git — a Conductor spawn is a worktree\nof it — so there is zero hardcoded or personal path and never a reach into an\nunrelated repo. Keep a pre-existing real .env.cogni instead of clobbering it, and\nguard the link/refresh helpers against an empty or self-referential root.","tree":{"sha":"20a4c7a0ff39c43e461e064c8399d24247fe2dcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/20a4c7a0ff39c43e461e064c8399d24247fe2dcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/4d838666cb8e7baf9c5beb46b195b7ec727fa986","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqM4a7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqf0QAIiccYQzst0OhkpxyepkY2Sd\ncIerizYqKYkz6jfalVBsQkh7VJ/SQgAmQBZhCVxeiveSJu/Dd10U6bg2fOK4LLWJ\nDjkyxrACqa4e3qKK7wlGeZYu/IcVmGxPIBaIkkteLVtXJqF4XTOjc9h1eSk/Udkl\nUfYr6+C0cGln32ADnghoDi1zj9dK4V5tNRA1KWehc6yh734A2zLAX3vsVA/z2D0T\nUBB5CHH5097UFhOEsNRERIJkLa/rRmzFIR1IH9Nzy5nhZH8ZKMqfbcEmofsb8jQb\n3TniAi+9YOb7zcEVnmnMrKY1Jee/YQHNPlUJ8MzPgAGfuPkRKIZ806J9rGkO90Vv\nT9Y2JiFgaTwHPv7CXSIFzOWoX+aj5zTTSrNYMDPfRoOKmexqFaXZjNLwEDk8JVIf\nlyF6rdIS9hhE7L0G5P/A6oft/gyDOUHYecEXCoxxTH2EuGmUibs+4jQHMgC7t9Af\n0NOmeskBbdwXQF0sjfsmbtIVDV6xxpZPSFhnw9DhHoLkD+hIcoqUM7DUriXNocqp\n69xM6uHUb3ziKZzZnF9XQHCuc1+4N2VSR04RHmiUb7XZtdE89wgiDO2w+rzukGfi\naTu0tz8r6ALdKqe9h8GNowiqsqeX6y1nvyn1JBYA/HEqqsvT5lMjg9pZ6rtHMt8+\nvPDevKV+R+7yoUb7NbpU\n=eSss\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 20a4c7a0ff39c43e461e064c8399d24247fe2dcb\nparent 0ca9f9b68f35a447c8065c0227127c65ddbf32d6\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781761723 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781761723 -0400\n\nfix(conductor): derive auth root from git, not a personal cogni-template path (#40)\n\nAUTH_ROOT hardcoded $HOME/dev/cogni-template as its final fallback, so on any\nnode other than the operator apex the setup script symlinked the wrong checkout's\n.env.cogni (wrong creds + var names) over the node's own and aborted with\n'exists and is not a symlink'.\n\nDerive the canonical (main) workspace from git — a Conductor spawn is a worktree\nof it — so there is zero hardcoded or personal path and never a reach into an\nunrelated repo. Keep a pre-existing real .env.cogni instead of clobbering it, and\nguard the link/refresh helpers against an empty or self-referential root.","verified_