/<slug>.storageState.json (no signin, no CI).\n- docs/guides/candidate-auth-bootstrap.md: the MetaMask + dedicated-profile + CDP\n  capture runbook, de-coupled from cogni-template (generic <node> slugs, no\n  internal tracker refs).\n- @playwright/test devDependency: required by the capture script's connectOverCDP.\n  Attaches to the human's running Chrome, so no browser download is needed.\n\nCloses the node-repo auth-bootstrap gap noted across beacon work.","tree":{"sha":"da26058bcf2892e244eca4238eb1acb4553f2b56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/trees/da26058bcf2892e244eca4238eb1acb4553f2b56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/git/commits/e0d4be28070ae9f0bfe22882c0cefeee307744f9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqM6uQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXC8QAItC8dzsuNGXSJ1BteWvNhYQ\nM6pOhnASIRGp7wBVk8gbLLu4qvPj09hV7aUp0O9J74FMrrKCIRyCll64cH4Rk57d\n8wWjP4l0rCx8Jnwyf3L/JXNR1glzluTqPZaRDy/InKnVXvYlN05jrqamfVjsGRdD\naT70ALHNOrcjSzTqXPMGmQ6k0gg6wruCS4sClmTglxBd/EPMqsaKcgTBpMt58AiR\n6t3ynjMKo3xYOt7EP7pR3XIV8REgElkYeqxNQM6N6EuJVYtKKHxgK88/RyZbeGZ4\nP6jq0QhlxMWBy1z2RaiPNwp9Y7WjttQgqtLmiK8+DtUQFGxwfBdCVdPpMwYeI1Af\nnVmCU0fYS0hkNgu6dy68ye2sea4Hk5N7Kl2MRB7C4meZ7Rh/vG8DaQMZ/N2dmnU7\nXbNhjWxyCwOMilbBxD+cnO5ksJtz1G49h9bwwmArHAIzLipz29RQ7Q8N29fZrMC2\ncJysWpW2QdonMoy9hOZOt6eJqG8fljWXiuiiccg/BjN3xGS5lOaYHFPlgF++kmsq\n4RNGm7DX/mn4QleaAXG5NdLcjpwd+8epMhEJfGT8A5S1cPkk7P+C4511EM1XoMN9\nAZr4qjXAVv3vQ0TuakeEY3NE3CpiwI6ndirIB3o5yR0OdeVvBACIhU+JB6tG/rbR\nFwCdKXiVCEtPRxl6xWgc\n=pjVB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree da26058bcf2892e244eca4238eb1acb4553f2b56\nparent fec090ea1c19d09717e3578f7266ef3267e6a453\nauthor Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com> 1781771152 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781771152 -0400\n\nfeat(auth): port candidate-auth-bootstrap (CDP-attach storageState capture) to node-template (#42)\n\nThe authed-Playwright bootstrap lived only in cogni-template + the operator\nmonorepo, so node-template forks (e.g. beacon) had no way to populate .local-auth\nand drive authed candidate-a flows. Port it so every fork self-serves:\n\n- scripts/dev/capture-authed-state.mjs: connects to a CDP-debuggable Chrome and\n  exports storageState to .local-auth/<slug>.storageState.json (no signin, no CI).\n- docs/guides/candidate-auth-bootstrap.md: the MetaMask + dedicated-profile + CDP\n  capture runbook, de-coupled from cogni-template (generic <node> slugs, no\n  internal tracker refs).\n- @playwright/test devDependency: required by the capture script's connectOverCDP.\n  Attaches to the human's running Chrome, so no browser download is needed.\n\nCloses the node-repo auth-bootstrap gap noted across beacon work.","verified_at":"2026-06-18T08:25:53Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/e0d4be28070ae9f0bfe22882c0cefeee307744f9","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/commit/e0d4be28070ae9f0bfe22882c0cefeee307744f9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/commits/e0d4be28070ae9f0bfe22882c0cefeee307744f9/comments","author":{"login":"derekg1729","id":58641509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjQxNTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58641509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729","html_url":"https://github.com/derekg1729","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derekg1729/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dere